### ========================================================
### PENGUJIAN API CRUD PRODUK (SPRING BOOT)
### Jika di Antigravity terpasang ekstensi "REST Client", 
### kamu bisa langsung klik tombol "Send Request" di atas setiap URL.
### ========================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 1. Ambil Semua Data Produk (Default: Halaman 1, 10 item)
GET {{baseUrl}}

### 2. Ambil Data dengan Fitur Pencarian (Search by Name)
GET {{baseUrl}}?search=macbook

### 3. Ambil Data dengan Pagination & Sorting (Harga Termahal ke Termurah)
GET {{baseUrl}}?page=0&size=2&sortBy=price&sortDir=desc

### 4. Ambil Detail 1 Produk Berdasarkan ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/1

### 5. Tambah Produk Baru (Berhasil / Valid terhubung ke User)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Headset Sony WH-1000XM5",
  "price": 4999000.0,
  "stock": 15,
  "description": "Headphone wireless dengan noise cancelling terbaik",
  "userId": 1
}

### 6. Uji Coba Error Validasi (Nama kosong & Harga negatif)
### Harusnya mengembalikan status 400 Bad Request dengan pesan error rapi
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": -50000.0,
  "stock": -2,
  "description": "Testing validasi gagal"
}

### 7. Update Produk Berdasarkan ID
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Asus TUF Gaming A15 (Updated)",
  "price": 14999000.0,
  "stock": 12,
  "description": "Spesifikasi di-upgrade ke RAM 16GB"
}

### 8. Hapus Produk Berdasarkan ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/1

